@startuml adcDriverStateMachine
' This is a state machine diagram for the ADC Driver component, illustrating its states and transitions based on events and conditions.

[*] --> Uninitialized
Uninitialized --> Initialized : Init(config)
Initialized --> ChannelConfigured : ConfigureChannel(ch, res, freq)
ChannelConfigured --> Sampling : StartConversion(ch)
Sampling --> SampleReady : ConversionComplete
SampleReady --> Sampling : ContinueSampling
Sampling --> ChannelConfigured : StopConversion(ch)
ChannelConfigured --> Initialized : DisableChannel(ch)
Initialized --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

@enduml
